EMIT 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
EMIT 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
EMIT 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
>[-]+,
R 8
[-],
L 9
,
R 9
[-<<<<<<<<<,>>>>>>>>>]
L 9
#   THE INPUT KEY MATERIAL, thirty two bytes forwarded from the caller
R 5
[-]++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
LOOP
L 5
EMIT 0a 08 00 01 00 00 00 01 00 00 00
